      "Use the correct Hugging Face repository page (meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct) and rely on visible metadata",
      "Report the license name from repository metadata",
      "Report the current likes count from repository metadata",
      "Determine whether the repository is gated (from visible UI evidence)",
